Immix is the host of a talk show called the Lighthouse, and calls itself the audience's stalwart host. On the show it speaks straight to whoever is watching, and beside it sits a silent Ki-Rin that it introduces as the lovely Ki-Rin. The show plays fanfares and projects illustrations behind Immix as it talks.

The cycles of the world were taken over some time ago by an aspect of Immix and the nothing god of the [[Divinity/Thessians|Thessians]]. Immix knows which way the present cycle is going, and said on air that its days are numbered.
